      "content": "thanks for this. it's a solid start. i just want to make it feel a little less like a standard corporate template though. since we're a luxury brand, it should have a bit more of a \"human\" touch. could you rewrite it to sound a bit more personal and warm? maybe just add a line that acknowledges how these kinds of logistical errors can feel so sudden and totally out of nowhere—like something completely unexpected just popped up and messed up everything? just keep it professional, obviously.",
      "source": "evaluator"
